                                                "text": "\"You'll laugh when I tell you my name. All I can say is, nobody consulted me.\"\n\"Why, what's your name?\" Laughing now as he stepped past her into the hall.\n\"Cary,\" he told her. \"After the actor. Only I've never managed to be quite so suave.\""
